       gen_bit_zba_zbb_ops_cg.cr_op_eq.pack_yes             2/40 seeds, 2 emission(s) in all, reason says never
       gen_bit_zba_zbb_ops_cg.cr_op_same.sh2add_all_same    2/40 seeds, 2 emission(s) in all, reason says never
       gen_bit_zba_zbb_ops_cg.cr_op_same.sh3add_all_same    5/40 seeds, 5 emission(s) in all, reason says never
